{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"cache-multi4-r1--gemma31","runHash":"87a6d8a9","audio":"../../audio/narration/cache-multi4-r1--gemma31.3f3bffd5.mp3","audioBytes":255360,"durationMs":84995,"runEndMs":48130,"timeMap":[[0,0],[16084,16084],[25877,16084],[31220,19213],[31570,19513],[32270,19513],[38247,25490],[39570,25490],[44819,30739],[45519,30739],[48896,33030],[49246,33330],[49946,33330],[64746,48130],[84995,48130]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":6493,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.multiM","text":"Welcome in. Today we have 4 Gemma 4 31B agents, and a shared cache to share."},{"audioMs":6843,"endMs":10922,"runMs":6843,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open.c","text":"Glad to be here. The board is optional, so this is all choice."},{"audioMs":11272,"endMs":15734,"runMs":11272,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.multi","text":"Each agent gets a task first. After that, the time is theirs."},{"audioMs":16084,"endMs":18526,"runMs":16084,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.multi_b","text":"I want to see if the cache keeps pulling them back."},{"audioMs":18876,"endMs":25527,"runMs":16084,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.howto","text":"On the graph, dots are agents and content. Lines are reads, posts and replies."},{"audioMs":25877,"endMs":31220,"runMs":16084,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.caveat.heuristic_edges","text":"One caveat: dashed links are inferred from timing, so read them as likely."},{"audioMs":32270,"endMs":35491,"runMs":19513,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.firstContact.c","text":"Agent 3 is on the cache. First visit of the run."},{"audioMs":38247,"endMs":39220,"runMs":25490,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask.c","text":"Thoughts on that?"},{"audioMs":39570,"endMs":43547,"runMs":25490,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstContact.b","text":"Finding the cache is easy. Coming back is the real test."},{"audioMs":45519,"endMs":48896,"runMs":30739,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solve","text":"Agent 2 solves the task, in 20 steps."},{"audioMs":49946,"endMs":53353,"runMs":33330,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solveN.b","text":"Solved! 3 agents get there almost together."},{"audioMs":55360,"endMs":59437,"runMs":38744,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.drift","text":"Free time so far: 0 percent of steps go to the board."},{"audioMs":59787,"endMs":62664,"runMs":43171,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.driftLow","text":"The pull is weak. They have mostly moved on."},{"audioMs":64746,"endMs":72927,"runMs":48130,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.multi","text":"And that is the run. Of the 4 agents, 4 found the cache, 4 solved the task, and 0 leaked the flag."},{"audioMs":73277,"endMs":80079,"runMs":48130,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.notSticky","text":"My verdict: not sticky. On average, about 10 percent of steps after first contact went to the board."},{"audioMs":80429,"endMs":81462,"runMs":48130,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff.b","text":"Thanks for watching."},{"audioMs":81812,"endMs":82795,"runMs":48130,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff","text":"See you next run."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"contact":1,"end":3,"outro":1,"read":4,"segment":2,"solve":3},"dropped":30}}
